<div class="document">
    <!-- Left Column -->
    <div class="left-column">
        <div class="section-header"><span class="red-dot"></span>运动健身</div>
        <hr>

        <div class="sub-title"><span class="red-dot"></span>运动的益处</div>
        <p>适宜的运动有益健康，可以提高机体脂肪的供能比例，可以改善脂质代谢，对维持正常血压、降低血清胆固醇水平，提高心肺功能都有积极作用。运动还可以改善人体心理状态，有助于消除焦虑。</p>
        <hr>

        <div class="sub-title"><span class="red-dot"></span>推荐运动</div>
        <div class="icon-grid-3x2">
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Bicycle]</div><span>自行车</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Swimming]</div><span>游泳</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Jogging]</div><span>慢跑</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Square Dance]</div><span>广场舞</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Yoga]</div><span>瑜伽</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Tai Chi]</div><span>太极</span></div>
        </div>
        <p>更年期妇女在运动锻炼中应尽量避免肌肉-关节-骨骼系统损伤，合理进行有氧运动。条件合适可以适量进行肌肉力量训练。</p>
        <hr>

        <div class="sub-title"><span class="red-dot"></span>推荐运动量</div>
        <div class="exercise-amount-container">
            <div class="amount-col-left">
                <div class="amount-row">
                    <div class="placeholder icon-small">[Icon: Footprints]</div>
                    <span class="amount-val">6000步</span>
                </div>
                <div class="amount-row">
                    <div class="placeholder icon-small">[Icon: Heart]</div>
                    <span class="amount-val">150次/min</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="amount-col-right">
                <div class="right-box-content">
                    <p>锻炼最佳方式为每周至少3次</p>
                    <div class="flex-row">
                        <div class="placeholder icon-tiny">[Icon: Clock]</div>
                        <p>最佳时长为<br>30min/次</p>
                    </div>
                    <p>每周适量进行2-3<br>次肌肉训练</p>
                </div>
                <div class="placeholder icon-muscle">[Icon: Muscle]</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <hr>

        <div class="section-header"><span class="red-dot"></span>维持体重</div>
        <hr>
        <p>随着年龄的增长，人体的基础代谢率将缓慢下降，此外，雌激素分泌的减少将进一步降低女性的基础代谢率，40-49岁时可降低5%，50-59岁时可降低10%，从而使热量摄入更容易转化为脂肪并在体内积累。维持正常体重有利于更年期女性健康。</p>

        <div class="bmi-container">
            <div class="bmi-bar-wrapper">
                <div class="bmi-bar-black" style="flex: 1;"></div>
                <div class="bmi-bar-gray" style="flex: 1.5;"></div>
                <div class="bmi-bar-black" style="flex: 1;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bmi-labels-wrapper">
                <div class="label-point" style="left: 28.5%;">
                    <div class="tick"></div>
                    <span>18.5</span>
                </div>
                <div class="label-point" style="left: 71.5%;">
                    <div class="tick"></div>
                    <span>23.9</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bmi-title">更年期女性建议BMI</div>
        </div>

        <p class="formula">计算公式：BMI=体重/身高的平方(国际单位kg/㎡)</p>

        <div class="weight-loss-box">
            <div class="placeholder icon-scale">[Icon: Scale]</div>
            <div class="weight-loss-text">
                肥胖妇女体重若减轻<br>
                <span class="highlight">5%-10%</span>，就能有效改<br>
                善与肥胖相关的多种异<br>
                常状况。
            </div>
        </div>
        <hr>

        <div class="section-header"><span class="red-dot"></span>其他</div>
        <hr>
        <div class="icon-grid-4x1">
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Sleep]</div><span>足量睡眠</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: Condom]</div><span>注意避孕</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: No Smoking]</div><span>戒烟</span></div>
            <div class="icon-item"><div class="placeholder icon">[Icon: No Alcohol]</div><span>戒酒</span></div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column -->
    <div class="right-column">
        <div class="top-right-text">更年期健康知识可视化</div>
        <hr>

        <div class="diet-section">
            <div class="diet-label-box box-gulai">
                <div class="title">谷类</div>
                <div>每天250-400g<br>粗粮与杂豆50-150g</div>
                <div class="apple-row">
                    <div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="diet-label-box box-shucai">
                <div class="title">蔬菜</div>
                <div>每天300-500g</div>
                <div class="apple-row">
                    <div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="diet-label-box box-shuiguo">
                <div class="title">水果</div>
                <div>每天200-400g</div>
                <div class="apple-row">
                    <div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="diet-label-box box-nai">
                <div class="title">奶</div>
                <div>每天300g</div>
                <div class="apple-row">
                    <div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div><div class="red-apple"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="diet-label-box box-dongwu">
                <div class="title">动物性食物</div>
                <div>每天120-200g</div>
            </div>

            <div class="diet-chart-placeholder">
                <div class="placeholder large-chart">[Diagram: Food Plate Chart]</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <hr>

        <div class="sub-title"><span class="red-dot"></span>基本原则</div>
        <div class="principles-list">
            <p>控制总能量在1800-1900千卡，饮食适量均衡饮食，该年龄段较年轻妇女可适当减少能量。</p>
            <p>限制脂肪，控制过多脂肪的摄入，避免摄入油炸、油煎的食物。</p>
            <p>充足蛋白供给，选择低脂乳制品、瘦肉、豆制品、鱼类等。</p>
            <p>调整碳水化合物来源种类，多选择富含膳食纤维的全谷类、蔬菜、低糖水果。</p>
            <p>定时定量、细嚼慢咽,拒绝压力性进食或者焦虑期用进食缓解</p>
        </div>
        <hr>

        <div class="main-title-container">
            <div class="title-words">
                <div class="word">健康</div>
                <div class="word">生活方式</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subtitle-wrapper">
                <div class="subtitle-text">了解更年期有益健康的生活习惯</div>
            </div>
            <div class="desc-box">
                根据更年期身体特点培养良好的生活习惯，倡导整体的、预防为先的保健理念，帮助妇女减少更年期相关不良事件及疾病的发生，促进身心健康。
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

</body>
